&Scoped-define SELF-NAME BUTTON-14
&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _CONTROL BUTTON-14 V-table-Win
ON CHOOSE OF BUTTON-14 IN FRAME F-Main /* Ayuda */
DO:
  MESSAGE "Elija el momento de la impresion del certificado" VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX INFORMATION.
END.

